<mxCell id="f-overview-splash-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#1565C0;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-splash"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="330" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-splash-h" value="Écran de démarrage" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#1565C0;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-splash"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="330" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-splash-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;electron/Splash.html&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Petite fenêtre sans bordure, transparente, toujours au premier plan : logo, roue, message d'état.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Messages écrits par &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;main.js&lt;/span&gt; : « Starting FragHub… », téléchargement de la base interne, « Loading internal databases… », erreurs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Fermée quand l'interface et le back-end sont prêts.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#3949AB;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Détail : page 2&amp;nbsp;→&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-splash"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="330" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<UserObject id="f-overview-settings" label="" link="data:page/id,f-settings"><mxCell style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#E6F4F2;strokeColor=#00897B;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="382" width="330" height="228" as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject>
<mxCell id="f-overview-settings-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#00897B;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-settings"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="330" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-settings-h" value="Écran de réglages" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#00897B;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-settings"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="330" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-settings-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;app/app.vue&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Bandeau de 6 onglets : INPUT, OUTPUT, Filters, De Novo, Output settings, Projects settings.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Interrupteur mode sombre (DarkReader), logo en filigrane, bouton START.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;START : passe à l'écran de progression puis envoie les paramètres au back-end (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;POST /run-analysis&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#C62828&quot;&gt;✕&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Champ numérique invalide : START bloqué ; run refusé ou serveur injoignable : message au-dessus de START.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#3949AB;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Détail : page 3&amp;nbsp;→&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-settings"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="330" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<UserObject id="f-overview-progress" label="" link="data:page/id,f-progress"><mxCell style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#F5EAF7;strokeColor=#8E24AA;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="636" width="330" height="168" as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject>
<mxCell id="f-overview-progress-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#8E24AA;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-progress"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="330" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-progress-h" value="Écran de progression" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#8E24AA;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-progress"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="330" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-progress-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;app/components/ProgressView.vue&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Journal du run reçu par Socket.IO : étapes, suppressions, barres terminées (vertes), barre en cours (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;ActiveProgress.vue&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Bouton STOP PROCESS (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;GET /stop-analysis&lt;/span&gt;) ; à la fin, onglet HTML RESULT (rapport dans un iframe) et CLOSE REPORT.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#3949AB;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Détail : page 4&amp;nbsp;→&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-progress"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="330" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-x4" value="&lt;b&gt;Processus et échanges&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#607D8B&quot;&gt;deux processus Electron + un processus Python&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#455A64;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="130" width="450" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<UserObject id="f-overview-main" label="" link="data:page/id,f-startup"><mxCell style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#E8F0FA;strokeColor=#1565C0;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="158" width="450" height="213" as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject>
<mxCell id="f-overview-main-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#1565C0;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-main"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="450" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-main-h" value="Processus principal Electron" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#1565C0;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-main"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="450" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-main-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;electron/main.js&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Au lancement : enregistre le protocole &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;app://&lt;/span&gt;, ouvre le splash, lance l'exécutable back-end &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;FragHub_Backend&lt;/span&gt;, crée la fenêtre principale cachée.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Attend le back-end (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;/health&lt;/span&gt;), la base interne (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;/database-status&lt;/span&gt;) et son chargement (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;/init-data&lt;/span&gt;) avant de montrer la fenêtre.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Sert la page depuis &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;GUI/.output/public&lt;/span&gt; via &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;app://-/index.html&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Boîtes de dialogue fichiers / dossier (IPC) ; tue le back-end à la fermeture (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;will-quit&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#3949AB;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Détail : page 2&amp;nbsp;→&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-main"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="450" height="185" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<UserObject id="f-overview-nuxt" label="" link="data:page/id,f-settings"><mxCell style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#E6F4F2;strokeColor=#00897B;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="397" width="450" height="198" as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject>
<mxCell id="f-overview-nuxt-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#00897B;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-nuxt"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="450" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-nuxt-h" value="Application Nuxt (la page)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#00897B;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-nuxt"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="450" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-nuxt-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;app/app.vue · app/components/ · app/composables/ · app/utils/&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Une seule page, rendu serveur désactivé, routeur en mode hash ; composants des onglets chargés automatiquement.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#607D8B&quot;&gt;↳&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;useState('parameters')&lt;/span&gt; : tous les réglages du run, partagés entre les onglets ; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;useState('isExecuting')&lt;/span&gt; : réglages ou progression ; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;useState('invalidFields')&lt;/span&gt; : champs numériques invalides.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Parle au back-end en HTTP (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;fetch http://127.0.0.1:8000&lt;/span&gt;) et en Socket.IO (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;socket.io-client&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#3949AB;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Détail : pages 3 et 4&amp;nbsp;→&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-nuxt"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="450" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-x5" value="&lt;b&gt;Pont, back-end, fichiers&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#455A64;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="130" width="330" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-preload" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#FDF0E7;strokeColor=#E8590C;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="158" width="330" height="153" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-preload-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#E8590C;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-preload"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="330" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-preload-h" value="Pont vers la page" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8590C;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-preload"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="330" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-preload-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;electron/preload.cjs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;contextBridge&lt;/span&gt; expose &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;window.electronAPI&lt;/span&gt; : &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;selectFiles()&lt;/span&gt; → &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;dialog:openFiles&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;selectFolder()&lt;/span&gt; → &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;dialog:openFolder&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Isolation de contexte activée, pas d'intégration Node dans la page : seul ce pont relie la page à Electron.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-preload"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="330" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-backend" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#FBF4E6;strokeColor=#B7791F;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="337" width="330" height="213" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-backend-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#B7791F;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-backend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="330" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-backend-h" value="Back-end Python" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#B7791F;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-backend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="330" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-backend-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;scripts/FragHub.py → exécutable FragHub_Backend&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Serveur FastAPI + Socket.IO sur &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;127.0.0.1:8000&lt;/span&gt;, lancé et arrêté par Electron.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;HTTP : &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;GET /health&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;/database-status&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;/init-data&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;/stop-analysis&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;/report?path=&lt;/span&gt; ; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;POST /run-analysis&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Socket.IO vers la page : &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;total_items&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;prefix&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;item_type&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;progress&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;step&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;deletion&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;completion&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#607D8B&quot;&gt;↳&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Voir le diagramme back-end (page 5 · Python et outils).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-backend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="330" height="185" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<UserObject id="f-overview-config" label="" link="data:page/id,f-build"><mxCell style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#37474F;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="576" width="330" height="198" as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject>
<mxCell id="f-overview-config-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#37474F;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-config"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="330" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-config-h" value="Configuration" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#37474F;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-config"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="330" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-config-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;nuxt.config.js · package.json&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Nuxt : &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;ssr: false&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;baseURL '/'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;buildAssetsDir 'assets'&lt;/span&gt;, routeur en mode hash, extraction du payload et manifeste désactivés (nécessaire sous &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;app://&lt;/span&gt;), module &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;vuetify-nuxt-module&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;package.json : &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;main = electron/main.js&lt;/span&gt;, modules ES ; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;electron-builder&lt;/span&gt; : NSIS (Windows), DMG (macOS), exécutable back-end copié dans &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;resources/bin/&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#3949AB;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Détail : page 5&amp;nbsp;→&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-config"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="330" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<UserObject id="f-overview-build" label="" link="data:page/id,f-build"><mxCell style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#37474F;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="800" width="330" height="213" as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject>
<mxCell id="f-overview-build-s" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#37474F;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-build"><mxGeometry x="0" y="14.0" width="330" height="14.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-build-h" value="Construction et tests" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#37474F;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-build"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="330" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="f-overview-build-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace;font-weight:bold;color:#263238&quot;&gt;build_frontend.py · build_all.py · GUI/tests/&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;npm install&lt;/span&gt; si besoin, puis &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;npm run generate&lt;/span&gt; → &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;GUI/.output/public&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;build_all.py&lt;/span&gt; : back-end (Rust + PyInstaller), front-end, puis &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;npm run build:electron&lt;/span&gt; → &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;GUI/dist_electron/&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Tests de l'interface : &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;npm test&lt;/span&gt; (Vitest) dans &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;GUI/&lt;/span&gt;, ou &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;python run_tests.py --gui&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-left:11px;text-indent:-11px&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp;Version 2.0.0 recopiée partout par &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New,monospace&quot;&gt;sync_version.py&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color:#3949AB;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Détail : page 5&amp;nbsp;→&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="f-overview-build"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="330" height="185" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
